ill wants to do it the  movie closes out with her saying yes yes  [Music]  yeah if that doesn't have you tearing up  then I don't know what will and that  closes out both the movie and our  breakdown and I hope you enjoyed going  back to it I'd of course love to hear  your thoughts on it and if there's  anything we missed then make sure you  leave it below huge thank you for all  your support on these older movie  breakdowns and if you want something  else to watch then make sure you check  out our one for Shutter Island there's  so many layers to the film and we go  through them all bit by bit to talk  about why it works so well that will be  linked on screen right now and with that  out of the way I've been Paul you've  been the best I'll see you next one take  care peace
 

